# "When this Equipment enters, attach it to target creature you control. Equipped creature gets +2/+1 and has flying. Equip {2}." On turn 1 Bot1's Armor enters and attaches to
# Llanowar Elves, a 1/1 ground creature: it becomes a 3/2 with flying. On turn 3 Equip is refused while Bot1's Ornithopter is on the stack (sorcery speed, CR 702.6a;
# the equip a moment later, with the stack empty, is the positive control): paying {2} moves the Armor to Ornithopter (0/2 flying -> 2/3 flying) and
# the Elves are a 1/1 with no keywords again.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Llanowar Elves
Iron Man Armor
Ornithopter
Forest x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

